    <bpmn:process id="W_W5395" name="W5395. Eligible-Receivable Criteria, Concentration Limits &amp; Advance-Rate Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Facility setup (W5394); periodic criteria review
Frequency: Setup; ~quarterly review
Volume: 1 eligibility framework/facility
Owner: Credit Analyst (Receivables Finance)
Participants: Credit Manager, Treasury, AR (VS-16)
Source: workflow W5395 — Eligible-Receivable Criteria, Concentration Limits &amp; Advance-Rate Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5395_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5395_Lane1" name="Credit Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5395_Lane2" name="Credit Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5395_Lane3" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5395_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5395_Start5" name="Facility setup (W5394); periodic criteria review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5395_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5395_Task6" name="Define eligible-receivable criteria: approved customers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define eligible-receivable criteria: approved customers, credit-insured/non-recourse eligibility, invoice age, and disputed-free.
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5395_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5395_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5395_Task7" name="Set concentration limits (max per customer, segment, region) and advance rates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set concentration limits (max per customer, segment, region) and advance rates (e.g. 80–90% investment-grade, 70% others).
Responsible (R): Credit Manager
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5395_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5395_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5395_Task8" name="Configure the criteria/limits/advance rates in the factoring system to gate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Configure the criteria/limits/advance rates in the factoring system to gate eligibility at submission (W5401).
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5395_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5395_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5395_Task9" name="Monitor dilution (credits/disputes/short-pays as % of sales) against facility…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Monitor dilution (credits/disputes/short-pays as % of sales) against facility thresholds.
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5395_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5395_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5395_Task10" name="Review and adjust criteria/limits quarterly based on portfolio performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Review and adjust criteria/limits quarterly based on portfolio performance (W5410).
Responsible (R): Credit Manager
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5395_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5395_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5395_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5395_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5395_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-797 (ensure controlled execution — Receivables Financing Strategy, Funder Relationships &amp; Program Setup (PA-189.1).) | - operational: eligibility accuracy; fraud detection on fabricated invoices; concentration-limit adherence.
Owner: Credit Analyst (Receivables Finance)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5395_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5395_Annotation12" targetRef="W5395_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
